mode: "100644"
text: "# Carousel Platform Specs\n\nEach platform's carousel has its own specs and culture. Match the build to the target.\n\n> Specs change; treat numbers as approximate and re-verify quarterly. The principles are durable.\n\n## Instagram carousel\n\n- **Slides:** up to 20 (raised from 10 in 2024). Mixed images/video allowed. The sweet spot is\n  still ~5–10; reserve 15–20 for photo dumps / deep walkthroughs that earn it.\n- **Aspect ratio:** 1:1 (square) or **4:5 (portrait)** — 4:5 takes more feed space and is usually\n  better. Keep all slides the same ratio.\n- **Cover:** shows in the feed and on the grid — must work at thumbnail size.\n- **Caption:** up to ~2,200 chars; the caption pulls people into slide 1 (hand to `caption-writer`).\n- **Saves & shares** are the goal signals; design reference-value content.\n- **Links:** not clickable → \"link in bio.\"\n\n## LinkedIn document (PDF) carousel\n\n- **Format:** a **PDF uploaded as a document** — renders as a swipeable carousel. A LinkedIn power\n  format: very high dwell and saves.\n- **Aspect ratio:** square (1:1) or portrait works; design for mobile legibility.\n- **Slides:** more generous than IG; still keep it tight and one-idea-per-slide.\n- **Post copy:** a short, strong text post pulls people into the PDF (hand to\n  `linkedin-post-writer`). Link in the first comment if any.\n- Great for frameworks, how-tos, and breakdowns to a professional audience.\n\n## TikTok photo carousel\n\n- **Format:** photo mode (swipeable images), often set to a sound.\n- **Aspect ratio:** 9:16 vertical.\n- **Style:** more casual/native than IG; can be screenshots, memes, or designed slides.\n- **Caption + keywords** matter for search; the cover still hooks.\n- **AI-disclosure** auto-handled by WoopSocial on TikTok for AI-generated media.\n\n## Cross-platform note\n\nA carousel can be repurposed across these, but **re-fit per platform** (ratio, slide count, register)\nrather than posting the identical file everywhere — see `cross-platform-repurposing`. Design once in\na flexible template, then export per platform's ratio.\n\n## Quick reference\n\n| Platform | Format | Ratio | Slides | Best for |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Instagram | image/video carousel | 4:5 or 1:1 | up to 20 | saves, teaching, story |\n| LinkedIn | PDF document | 1:1 or portrait | generous | frameworks, B2B authority |\n| TikTok | photo mode | 9:16 | several | casual, native, reach |\n"
